{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "MCreator 生成区守卫清单：记录粉羊玩法对『生成文件』做过的全部改动。MCreator 重新生成代码后用 guard.ps1 -Action apply 一键还原。",
  "note": "canonical/ 下的文件是『已知良好版本』，由 guard.ps1 -Action snapshot 从当前工作副本刷新。改完机制、确认编译通过后再 snapshot 一次即可。",
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "pink-sheep-entity",
      "kind": "full",
      "why": "粉羊薄壳：MCreator 重生成会还原成 Monster 模板（非 Sheep → 无羊模型/无粉色/无剪毛）",
      "path": "src/main/java/net/mcreator/mcanomalyarchives/entity/PinkSheepEntity.java",
      "canonical": "PinkSheepEntity.java",
      "expectAll": [
        "extends Sheep",
        "protected void registerGoals()",
        "protected void customServerAiStep()",
        "public static AttributeSupplier.Builder createAttributes()",
        "public static void init(RegisterSpawnPlacementsEvent event)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pink-sheep-renderer",
      "kind": "full",
      "why": "渲染沿用原版羊模型+羊毛层；MCreator 重生成会还原成默认人形/Humanoid 渲染",
      "path": "src/main/java/net/mcreator/mcanomalyarchives/client/renderer/PinkSheepRenderer.java",
      "canonical": "PinkSheepRenderer.java",
      "expectAll": [
        "extends MobRenderer<Sheep, SheepModel<Sheep>>",
        "new SheepFurLayer(",
        "ModelLayers.SHEEP"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pink-sheep-registration",
      "kind": "block",
      "why": "实体注册被还原成 MobCategory.MONSTER + sized(0.6f,1.8f)（巨型怪物判定）",
      "path": "src/main/java/net/mcreator/mcanomalyarchives/init/McanomalyarchivesModEntities.java",
      "canonical": "McanomalyarchivesModEntities.PINK_SHEEP.txt",
      "startAnchor": "EntityType<PinkSheepEntity>> PINK_SHEEP = register(",
      "endAnchor": ".sized(",
      "expectAll": [
        "MobCategory.CREATURE",
        "sized(0.9f, 1.3f)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pink-sheep-biome-modifier",
      "kind": "full",
      "why": "刷怪权重文件；实际刷怪由结构式生成器接管，这里保持原样避免二次自然刷怪",
      "path": "src/main/resources/data/mcanomalyarchives/neoforge/biome_modifier/pink_sheep_biome_modifier.json",
      "canonical": "pink_sheep_biome_modifier.json",
      "expectAll": [
        "mcanomalyarchives:pink_sheep"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mod-init-hooks",
      "kind": "contains",
      "why": "MCreator 的 user code block 一般能保住；万一丢了事件处理器就完全不生效",
      "path": "src/main/java/net/mcreator/mcanomalyarchives/McanomalyarchivesMod.java",
      "fixHint": "手动加回 McanomalyarchivesMod.java 的 '// Start of user code block mod init' 区块内",
      "mustContain": [
        "PinkSheepLookHandler.init();",
        "PinkSheepLuckyHandler.init();",
        "PinkSheepCalamityHandler.init();",
        "PinkSheepStructureSpawnHandler.init();",
        "BlinkClientHandler.init();"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mechanics-package",
      "kind": "exists",
      "why": "机制归属区（非生成区）：这两个文件丢了说明有人把它挪回了生成区",
      "fixHint": "从 git 恢复：git checkout -- src/main/java/net/mcreator/mcanomalyarchives/anomaly/",
      "exists": [
        "src/main/java/net/mcreator/mcanomalyarchives/anomaly/pinksheep/PinkSheepMechanics.java",
        "src/main/java/net/mcreator/mcanomalyarchives/anomaly/pinksheep/PinkSheepHabitat.java"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "no-stale-prefix",
      "kind": "noMatch",
      "why": "旧模组名 strangerecord 残留会导致注册名/网络通道不一致（联机掉线）",
      "fixHint": "搜索并改回 mcanomalyarchives",
      "glob": "*.java",
      "searchRoot": "src/main/java",
      "pattern": "net\\.mcreator\\.strangerecord|strangerecord:"
    },
    {
      "id": "pink-sheep-renderer-registration",
      "kind": "contains",
      "why": "渲染器注册表行（init 包，生成区）：MCreator 重写后粉羊会失去羊模型渲染",
      "path": "src/main/java/net/mcreator/mcanomalyarchives/init/McanomalyarchivesModEntityRenderers.java",
      "fixHint": "补回 event.registerEntityRenderer(McanomalyarchivesModEntities.PINK_SHEEP.get(), PinkSheepRenderer::new);",
      "mustContain": [
        "PINK_SHEEP.get(), PinkSheepRenderer::new"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pink-sheep-entity-hooks",
      "kind": "contains",
      "why": "实体注册表里的 init/属性钩子调用（生成区）：丢了粉羊就没有血量与生成规则",
      "path": "src/main/java/net/mcreator/mcanomalyarchives/init/McanomalyarchivesModEntities.java",
      "fixHint": "补回 PinkSheepEntity.init(event); 与 event.put(PINK_SHEEP.get(), PinkSheepEntity.createAttributes().build());",
      "mustContain": [
        "PinkSheepEntity.init(event);",
        "PinkSheepEntity.createAttributes().build()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "structure-nbt-namespace",
      "kind": "nbtNoMatch",
      "why": "结构模板 .nbt 是 gzip 二进制，改名时的批量文本替换扫不到：里面残留 strangerecord 会让结构生成时方块变空气、实体不生成，而编译/构建毫无报错",
      "fixHint": "python tools/structure-fix/fix_structure_nbt.py fix --apply 然后 verify",
      "path": "src/main/resources/data/mcanomalyarchives/structure",
      "glob": "*.nbt",
      "pattern": "strangerecord:"
    },
    {
      "id": "structure-jigsaw-refs",
      "kind": "contains",
      "why": "拼图池/结构 JSON 指向的模板与结构名（改名后必须同步）",
      "path": "src/main/resources/data/mcanomalyarchives/worldgen/template_pool/garden.json",
      "fixHint": "确认 location 指向 mcanomalyarchives:garden 且 structure/*.nbt 存在",
      "mustContain": [
        "mcanomalyarchives:garden"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "stange-cloud-registration",
      "kind": "block",
      "why": "伪云注册块：碰撞箱必须覆盖模型（30×5，否则视锥剔除会让整朵云消失）、出现距离 128，并且【必须是 AMBIENT 分类】—— CREATURE 分类会被区块生成刷怪（NaturalSpawner.spawnMobsForChunkGeneration 只取 CREATURE）选中，30 格宽的生成 AABB 横跨邻接区块，导致世界生成时崩溃（2026-09-12 实际发生过）",
      "path": "src/main/java/net/mcreator/mcanomalyarchives/init/McanomalyarchivesModEntities.java",
      "canonical": "StangeCloud.registration.txt",
      "startAnchor": "EntityType<StangeCloudEntity>> STANGE_CLOUD = register(",
      "endAnchor": ".sized(",
      "expectAll": [
        "sized(30f, 5f)",
        "setTrackingRange(128)",
        "MobCategory.AMBIENT"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "stange-cloud-element-hitbox",
      "kind": "contains",
      "why": "MCreator 元素的碰撞箱字段（modelWidth/modelHeight）是生成 .sized() 的源头：不改这里，下次重新生成又会变回 0.6×1.8",
      "path": "elements/StangeCloud.mod.json",
      "fixHint": "把 modelWidth 改成 30.0、modelHeight 改成 5.0（对应渲染放大 20 倍后的模型尺寸）",
      "mustContain": [
        "\"modelWidth\": 30.0",
        "\"modelHeight\": 5.0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pink-sheep-advancements",
      "kind": "exists",
      "why": "粉羊进度线（幸运粉羊 / 眨眼之间 / 陨石问候）：成就定义在 MCreator 元素里、由它生成 advancement 资源，任一侧丢了就永远拿不到成就",
      "fixHint": "确认 elements/PinkSheep*mod.json 存在，并在 MCreator 里对这三个成就重新生成代码",
      "exists": [
        "src/main/resources/data/mcanomalyarchives/advancement/pink_sheep_sighting.json",
        "src/main/resources/data/mcanomalyarchives/advancement/pink_sheep_blink.json",
        "src/main/resources/data/mcanomalyarchives/advancement/pink_sheep_calamity.json",
        "elements/PinkSheepSighting.mod.json",
        "elements/PinkSheepBlink.mod.json",
        "elements/PinkSheepCalamity.mod.json"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "comfort-config-registration",
      "kind": "contains",
      "why": "舒适度配置的注册调用（写在 user code block 里，MCreator 会保留）。必须是【无参】调用：一旦写成 register(modContainer) 就会依赖构造器签名，而 MCreator 重生成时会把签名改回单参 —— 2026-09-12 就是这样炸了一次编译（调用行被 user code block 保留、签名被改回）",
      "path": "src/main/java/net/mcreator/mcanomalyarchives/McanomalyarchivesMod.java",
      "fixHint": "改成 net.mcreator.mcanomalyarchives.config.ComfortConfig.register();（无参，ModContainer 由它自己从 ModList 取）",
      "mustContain": [
        "ComfortConfig.register();"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "comfort-config-no-param-call",
      "kind": "noMatch",
      "why": "反向检查：禁止再出现依赖构造器参数的配置注册写法",
      "fixHint": "把 ComfortConfig.register(modContainer) 改回无参调用；构造器签名保持 MCreator 生成的样子即可",
      "glob": "McanomalyarchivesMod.java",
      "searchRoot": "src/main/java/net/mcreator/mcanomalyarchives",
      "pattern": "ComfortConfig\\.register\\(modContainer\\)"
    },
